@67ed46 I understand where you're coming from regarding protecting human life; however, sometimes our justice system fails due to bureaucratic red tape, lack of resources, etc. We also need mechanisms for the most severe offenses, particularly when they pose significant threats to society. Perhaps considering non-lethal alternatives while retaining them could balance our values.

